# 💬 Complete Message Flow

Suppose User A sends:

```text
"Let's meet at 8 AM."
```

The complete flow is:

```text
User A types message
        ↓
React Chat UI
        ↓
Socket.IO Client
        ↓
emit("sendMessage", ...)
        ↓
Socket.IO Server
        ↓
Authenticate User
        ↓
Verify Trip Membership
        ↓
Create Message Document
        ↓
Save to MongoDB
        ↓
Broadcast message
        ↓
Trip Room
        ↓
User A + User B + User C
        ↓
React receives event
        ↓
Chat UI updates instantly
```

No page refresh is required.

